309			"Output exactly one line: one taxonomy path, or two comma-separated paths only if the fact genuinely spans two top-level categories. " +
310			"Each path is three lowercase segments: category.subcategory.type. Invent a new three-level path only under an existing top-level category. " +
311			"Output only the path line, no prose.\n\n" + factTaxonomyBlock(taxonomy)
312	}
